<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Samrand says talks on control continue.</title>
<headline>Samrand says talks on control continue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Samrand Development Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday that negotiations were continuing regarding the disposal by Landmarks Bhd of its shareholding in and its claims against LB International Holdings Ltd, the controlling shareholder of Samrand, to Bafana Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>The company urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
